  "dcterms:title": "CHW app",
  "dcterms:description": "The OHS app on the CHW's phone: reads a foreign DVC without verifying it (triage read, STT-VER-011), registers the child and records a referral, all offline, syncing later.\n\n**Persona**: Offline-first Android app; must never present an unverified record as verified.\n\n**Also known as**: Triage reader (SMART Trust Receiver, read-unverified)\n\n**Played in the journeys by**: CHW app, Lao PDR (Country B) (fictional).",
